    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27852" root="عبس" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبِسٌ</span></b>  [part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبِسَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And occurring in
the A, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دعب</span>, in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُنَافِقُ عَبِسٌ قَطِبٌ</span>,
in which both of the epithets are app. altered in
form to assimilate them to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعِبٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَعِبٌ</span> by
which they are there preceded]: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَابِسٌ</span>.

